## earlier the same day, wake at 14:17:43: same 29.5 s silence (14:19:03.776 ->
## 14:19:33.287 recmode ok), also survived: we sat right on the limit every time.
## After a wake the body sits in a standby: play mode, lens unpowered (getinfo lens
## has no lens name) until the first recmode (then lens_Atta, full power-up).
## Control 14:46:20-14:47:36: the same body fully on (rec, lens powered, accepted
## session) with the server frozen for 75 s stayed on Wi-Fi and kept the session.
## So the ~30 s sleep is the post-wake standby. LUMIX Sync's CameraWatchLoop sends
## getstate every 1 s from right after device_name (docs/lumix-sync-wifi-flow.md s5).
